================================================================================================================
  SECTION 34.2 -- TAIL-RISK HEDGE: SMALL CONSTANT ALLOCATION TO OTM SPY PUTS
================================================================================================================

Strike: 5% OTM (K=0.95xspot). Roll: monthly, 30d target tenor. Sigma: flat trailing VIX (skew ignored -- understates true hedge cost, flattering the hedge). r=4.5%. Costs: 2% half-spread + 0.5% commission on entry (buyer pays the ask), same sec 24/26 assumptions.

Data: SPY+VIX daily, 1993-01-29 .. 2026-06-16, 8,402 days

UNHEDGED SPY baseline (full period): Sharpe 0.648  CAGR 10.85%  total_return 3003.7%  maxDD 55.19%

